WIP, feel free to commit changes you feel are needed.

Currently, you need to install cobra package and run go build of cloned files.

Get help for any command by using `--help` or `-h`:
  gobunny --help
  gobunny pullzones --help
  gobunny pullzones <command> --help
  gobunny pullzones hostname <subcommand> --help
  gobunny pullzones rules <subcommand> --help

commands that are currently working ([mandatory argument], (optional argument)):

gobunny pullzones create [pullZone name] [origin]
gobunny pullzones clone [sourcePullZone] [targetPullZone]
gobunny pullzones listAll
gobunny pullzones rules [pullZone]
gobunny pullzones rules add [pullZone] [rule.json]
gobunny pullzones rules copy [sourcePullZone] [targetPullZone]
gobunny pullzones rules delete [pullZone] [guid]
gobunny pullzones rules toggle [pullZone] [guid] [on|off]
gobunny pullzones purge [pullZone]
gobunny pullzones delete [pullZone] (-y)
gobunny pullzones enable [pullZone]
gobunny pullzones disable [pullZone]
gobunny pullzones hostname add [pullZone] [hostname]
gobunny pullzones hostname list [pullZone]
gobunny pullzones hostname cert [pullZone] [hostname]
gobunny pullzones hostname forcessl [pullZone] [hostname] [on|off]
gobunny pullzones hostname remove [pullZone] [hostname]
